(text "00_top\n\nCommon core (always on board):\n 01_connector  J1 2x08 to carrier J2, ESD\n 02_power      rails, bulk, AVDD filter, test points\n 03_hwid       4-bit HWID straps\n 04_bus        I2C, INT routing, expansion header\n\nVariants (one active per PCB):\n 10_module_potentiometers  4-8 pots, 2x ADS1115  [active]\n 11_module_keypad          4x4 matrix, MCP23017   [excluded from board]" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df14060c-cce8-5095-9e4a-e16567a8390f"))
(text "Assumptions (see sheet notes)\n- J1 is the mating half of carrier J2; pinout is the carrier README table\n- Daughter board is 50x50 mm, 4 layers, 4x M2.5 holes, same as carrier\n- One module per carrier port; I2C pull-ups live on the carrier\n- INT = TRT_GPIO_1 by default (no dedicated INT pin on J2)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ad3cab5f-5c89-53b9-a49b-295305828968"))
